-- the characteristic polynomial det(λ − q_123) at the vertex with doubled spins J1 … J4: p_0 = 1,
-- p_1 = λ, then one step for each further basis vector. Its roots are the eigenvalues of q_123; the
-- vertex's volume eigenvalues are √|2Z λ| in the units of the volume operator.
vol-charpoly : Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat → List SQ
vol-charpoly J1 J2 J3 J4 = snd (vol-steps (nat-half (monus (vol-amax J1 J2 J3 J4) (vol-amin J1 J2 J3 J4))) J1 J2 J3 J4 (plus (vol-amin J1 J2 J3 J4) 2) (cons sq-one nil , cons sq-zero (cons sq-one nil)))
